items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></li><li>酶的 HS 编码参考：3507.90. <span><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.datamyne.com/hts/35/350790?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">笛卡尔 Datamyne</span></span></span></a></span></span></li></ol>`} />
